  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle is held at point Y, located at the same distance from the centres of two large spherical masses. The particle is not influenced by any other masses.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What happens when the particle is released?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">It moves to point X and comes to rest there.</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">It remains at point Y.</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">It oscillates about point X.</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">It moves vertically upwards.</li>\n</ol>"
  },
